linXiv-web
Copyright 2026 linXiv-web contributors

This product is a web interface for linXiv (https://github.com/linxiv-dev/linXiv),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The container image builds and
bundles the linXiv `linxiv` CLI from upstream source.

The container image also bundles the pdfium library from
https://github.com/bblanchon/pdfium-binaries (BSD-3-Clause / Apache-2.0).

The web interface bundles the Inter typeface (https://rsms.me/inter/, files from the
linXiv desktop app), licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(web/public/fonts/Inter-OFL.txt).

The favicon and apple-touch icon (web/public/favicon.ico, apple-touch-icon.png) are
the linXiv application icon, from https://github.com/linxiv-dev/linXiv (Apache-2.0).
